A sprite: a square sprite moving across the screen.
C64 BASIC V2, from BASICv2Quick.guide, example 4.

10 PRINT CHR$(147)
20 FOR I=0 TO 62 : POKE 832+I,255 : NEXT I
30 POKE 2040,13 : REM DATA AT 13*64=832
40 POKE 53287,7 : REM YELLOW
50 POKE 53249,140 : REM Y
60 POKE 53269,1 : REM SPRITE 0 ON
70 FOR X=24 TO 255
80 POKE 53248,X
90 NEXT X
100 GOTO 70
